{"id":"n56004-1-7","stage":3,"title":"몫 · 份","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56004-1-7-1","ko":"피자를 시켰는데 네 몫으로 몇 조각 남겨 놨어.","zh":"我点了披萨，给你留了几块当你的份哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"피자를","meaning":"比萨","explanation":"피자：比萨；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"피자","audio":"/audio/383a267d08e55bc1b4c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26909","senseId":"1","lemma":"피자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시켰는데","meaning":"点，叫","explanation":"시키다：点，叫；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"시키다","audio":"/audio/0258d8fe6108bb9cba15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29769","senseId":"2","lemma":"시키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몫으로","meaning":"份，份额","explanation":"몫：份，份额；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"몫","audio":"/audio/616a28415aac91a2a451.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56004","senseId":"1","lemma":"몫","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조각","meaning":"块儿","explanation":"조각：块儿","readings":[{"term":"조각","audio":"/audio/652d4b53b484a0620da2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24575","senseId":"3","lemma":"조각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남겨","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남기다：剩，剩下；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"남기다","audio":"/audio/a129ccc910d85b760984.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64371","senseId":"1","lemma":"남기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놨어.","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"383a267d08e55bc1","term":"피자","zh":"比萨","audio":"/audio/383a267d08e55bc1b4c9.mp3","entryId":"26909","definition":"一种源于意大利的食物，在圆而扁的面饼上面覆盖番茄、肉类、奶酪以及其他配料，并烘烤而成。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"0258d8fe6108bb9c","term":"시키다","zh":"点，叫","audio":"/audio/0258d8fe6108bb9cba15.mp3","entryId":"29769","definition":"下单购买食物、酒、饮料等。","pronunciation":["시키다"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"616a28415aac91a2","term":"몫","zh":"份，份额","audio":"/audio/616a28415aac91a2a451.mp3","entryId":"56004","definition":"指多人分某东西时，每个人能分到的部分。","pronunciation":["목"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"652d4b53b484a062","term":"조각","zh":"块儿","audio":"/audio/652d4b53b484a0620da2.mp3","entryId":"24575","definition":"数从一个物体中摘下或掉落下来的一小部分的计量单位。","pronunciation":["조각"]},{"id":"a129ccc910d85b76","term":"남기다","zh":"剩，剩下","audio":"/audio/a129ccc910d85b760984.mp3","entryId":"64371","definition":"没用完，留下了一部分。","pronunciation":["남기다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","pronunciation":["노타"]}],"audio":"/audio/7540905c261a4559c909.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56004-1-7-2","ko":"나는 배가 안 고프니까 네가 내 몫까지 먹으렴.","zh":"我不饿，你把我的那份也吃掉吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배가","meaning":"肚子","explanation":"배：肚子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20211","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고프니까","meaning":"饿，饥饿","explanation":"고프다：饿，饥饿；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"고프다","audio":"/audio/a55fb1c7a8a68fcb81c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18396","senseId":"1","lemma":"고프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몫까지","meaning":"份，份额","explanation":"몫：份，份额；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"몫","audio":"/audio/616a28415aac91a2a451.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56004","senseId":"1","lemma":"몫","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹으렴.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；으렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"肚子","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"20211","definition":"人或动物的身体中胸部以下、腿部以上的部分。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"a55fb1c7a8a68fcb","term":"고프다","zh":"饿，饥饿","audio":"/audio/a55fb1c7a8a68fcb81c1.mp3","entryId":"18396","definition":"肚子空了，想吃东西。","pronunciation":["고프다"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"616a28415aac91a2","term":"몫","zh":"份，份额","audio":"/audio/616a28415aac91a2a451.mp3","entryId":"56004","definition":"指多人分某东西时，每个人能分到的部分。","pronunciation":["목"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/0724274d586b1605af29.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.165,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=56004","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":114,"sequenceScore":2.9917,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我不饿，你把我的那份也吃掉吧。","看啊，这是我画的画哦。","我点了披萨，给你留了几块当你的份哦。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我不饿，你把我的那份也吃掉吧。","我点了披萨，给你留了几块当你的份哦。","看啊，这是我画的画哦。"],"answer":0}]}
